cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use RMC Workbench in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "RMC Workbench: monitoring and interpreting RMCProfile fits"
abstract: >-
  A browser dashboard for RMCProfile runs: fits, structures, atomic displacements,
  symmetry tools and an AI Copilot that answers by calling analysis tools. Runs in the
  browser; data stay on the user's machine.
